              {
                ":answer/id": "3d8c7b32-ce0b-5c14-8674-065f178cb791",
                ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
                ":answer/value": "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -4 \\\\ -3 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}"
              },
              {
                ":answer/id": "a7a1ea73-2832-5ebe-b63e-5e5a144f916a",
                ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
                ":answer/value": "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}"
              },
              {
                ":answer/id": "5b6fdaae-95d6-5e14-a9fe-27c8a65941e4",
                ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
                ":answer/value": "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -4 \\\\ -3 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -6\\end{bmatrix}"
              }
            ],
            ":answer-field/correct": [
              ":answer/id",
              "3d8c7b32-ce0b-5c14-8674-065f178cb791"
            ]
          }
        ],
        ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
        ":question/worked-solution": "We add the corresponding entries:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P+Q & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 \\\\ -4 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1+2 & (-1)+(-3) \\\\ (-4)+1 & 0+1 \\\\ (-1)+2 & 2+(-4)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -4 \\\\ -3 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"
      },
